"""Transactional metadata authority for the OS-local OptPilot realm.

Every mutation is serialized by a SQLite ``BEGIN IMMEDIATE`` transaction and
is replayable by a realm-global operation id.  Filesystem content publication
remains a separate data-plane concern; this module is its sole metadata
authority.
"""

